><li> <strong> Mockery </strong></li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1083810/extras/1220217a152dcdd35267db31e86b6426.webp?t=1729003775\" width=55 height=53 /></span> - In the next 8 seconds, your enemy's attack is blocked.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1083810/extras/5c15eea9672336e91be1bf53595d93f1.webp?t=1729003775\" width=55 height=53 /></span> - Remove any booster or mockery that the opponent has accumulated. (exclusive on Versus mode)<br><br><br><strong> Have fun with 05 unmissable game modes: </strong><br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1083810/extras/a18d4476cf127b827123e50fccb241f1.webp?t=1729003775\" width=90 height=59 /></span> -  Save the Cerebine Kingdom from collapse by facing ever more challenging enemy reigns.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1083810/extras/4fae23766ddcf9c6cc192d4320efec8c.webp?t=1729003775\" width=80 height=59 /></span> - Destroy the enemy's tower before time runs out or weep in your tower\u2019s wreckage.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1083810/extras/ad8d01d2a2b4285f511237afd91d544a.webp?t=1729003775\" width=74 height=59 /></span> - Great place to train, here you will face random battles with random difficulties.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1083810/extras/8d179741a45b7f850d983d77d0d8c51d.webp?t=1729003775\" width=128 height=55 /></span> - This game mode is for the strong! All your skill and agility will be put to the test.  Will you stand it up?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1083810/extras/01946c94286271e12aa4e969fec6b8fd.webp?t=1729003775\" width=82 height=62 /></span> - Challenge your friends and family to battle. Who will win?<br><br>- P.S.: To be able to play the game on 'Versus mode', 02 controllers connected to your computer will be needed.<br><br><br><strong> Acquire   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1083810/extras/d56d1aa60b8ecb5a3b4fa52f1b03d23b.webp?t=1729003775\" width=42 height=36 /></span>  \u201cNeurons\u201d and   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1083810/extras/c95e403a75405af1c289cc80dcb67590.webp?t=1729003775\" width=42 height=36 /></span>  \u201cGold\u201d, to buy new attack machines, towers, etc\u2026 </strong><br><br>- In the War Solution each Attack Machine and Tower has its own attributes that make all the difference in a combat where each second counts. And some of them may have special abilities.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1083810/extras/2938c5f0706db907dedd1fe5ad12bf7e.avif?t=1729003775\" width=610 height=113 /></span><br><br><strong>Attack machines:</strong> <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1083810/extras/9b078e2ce7d40f328512056fe61bbcab.avif?t=1729003775\" width=380 height=108 /></span><br><br><strong> Skins:</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1083810/extras/7ac81e2027551357ee516b4303c5e125.avif?t=1729003775\" width=380 height=108 /></span><br><br><strong>Defense towers: </strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=