019s not a good strategy to click randomly on any alternative, because every wrong answer reduces your resolution time and also decreases your attack power.<br><br>- Agility will be rewarded during the battle with 'surprise boxes'  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1083810/extras/d79b80bce8d7623dcf14f9149bf26b1d.webp?t=1729003775\" width=32 height=32 /></span>  that will randomly appear on the game screen \u2013 this boxes may contain 'mockery' or 'boosters'. Be smart and grab them, otherwise your adversary will do it.<br><br>- Caution: by grabbing a 'surprise box', <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1083810/extras/d79b80bce8d7623dcf14f9149bf26b1d.webp?t=1729003775\" width=32 height=32 /></span>  its content  will replace any unused advantage that you have conquered.<br><br>- Never give up! Even if you have lost your attack machine\u2026 If you master the next 03 questions, you will recover it.<br><br>- Your attack machine can be regained, as the one of your enemy. You got to act quickly to destroy its tower, after destroying its attack machine this way its machine will not be regained<br><br>- There are some tips to speed  your thinking up in the game book.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1083810/extras/d6e4d696386af9b96dcaf434a8988bd7.avif?t=1729003775\" width=300 height=168 /></span>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"c0344afa67049eefa2e8bfe3da31251831d6d841.jpg","localized_name":"1st VICTORY!","name":"1st VICTORY!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1083810/c0344afa67049eefa2e8bfe3da31251831d6d841.jpg"},{"icon":"fb65f057612923b6e3bf35616e523e1bdb9c7af1.jpg","localized_name":"LIVE AND LEARN!","name":"LIVE AND LEARN!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.s